# Deny everything by default. This project contains restricted MIMIC data.
*

# Repository metadata and safe source-only directories.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!scripts/
!scripts/*.py
!scripts/safedrug_percluster/
!scripts/safedrug_percluster/*.py
!tests/
!tests/*.py
!docs/
!docs/**

# Never track generated/runtime files even inside allowlisted directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/

